# Tactiq user app — optional backend configuration.
#
# The app runs fully in Demo Mode with no backend: accounts, preferences,
# calibration, training progress and history are stored in this browser only.
#
# To enable real sign-in, sign-up and password reset, create a Supabase
# project (https://supabase.com), open Project Settings → API, copy the values
# below into a file named `.env`, and restart the dev server.
#
# The anon/public key is safe in a browser app: it only grants what your
# Row-Level-Security policies allow. NEVER put a service_role key here.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
